Sloth-Mod Free Use Terms
========================

Applies to Sloth-Mod 1.1.2 and every later version.
Copyright (c) 2026 DeusesPR. All rights reserved.

1. Free to use. You may download, install and use Sloth-Mod at no cost, for
   any purpose, including making mods, videos, servers and modpacks.

2. What you make is yours. Mods, pictures, sounds and other things you create
   with Sloth-Mod belong to you. You may share, publish or sell them. Parts
   from other projects inside them keep their own licenses.

3. Sharing the app. You may pass on the unchanged, official installer for
   free, as long as you do not charge for it and do not present it as your
   own product.

4. What is not allowed. You may not sell, rent or sublicense Sloth-Mod itself,
   distribute changed versions of it, use its code or built-in engine to make
   a competing product, remove its notices, or use the Sloth-Mod name or logo
   for another product. Reverse engineering is not allowed, except where the
   law gives you that right regardless of these terms.

5. Third-party parts. Sloth-Mod contains open-source components. Their
   licenses are listed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md and in the app (Settings,
   About). These terms do not limit any right those licenses give you.

6. No warranty. Sloth-Mod is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
   To the extent the law allows, the authors are not liable for any damage
   arising from its use. Mods are programs: only play mods you trust.

